<PracticeSet />

<AtTheTable>

Ask what you plan to do on the next street before buying a two-card draw. The coach’s direct model deliberately stops at showdown without later bets.

</AtTheTable>

<QuantCorner>

A staged investment can require follow-on funding before its final payoff. Backward evaluation reveals costs that a single-step success probability hides.

</QuantCorner>
